title: "AI-Powered Scientific Image Data Management Platform for Metadata-Aware Retrieval, Acquisition-Robust Representation, Data Integrity Assessment, and Anomaly-Aware Curation"
abstract: "A publication-grade, FAIR-compliant scientific image data management platform integrating foundation vision representations, acquisition-aware contrastive adaptation, multi-stage duplicate and anomaly curation, and scalable vector retrieval."
